ness of space.\n\n\u2026 or just simply enjoy the ride.\n\n\nHighlights:\n\nTake a high orbit around the earth, visit the far side of the Moon. Fly in close to Moon\u2019s surface and understand the formation of lunar features.\n\nSee our fragile home, Earth, from a completely new perspective.\n\nVisit Mars and its companion moons. Fly in low and close over some of Mars\u2019 ancient geological features.\n\nGo deeper into the Solar system; graze upon Jupiter\u2019s swirling clouds and swing around some of its fascinating moons.\n\n\nFeatures:\n\n* High quality 3d real-time rendered visuals for truly immersive feel.\n* True to scale planets and moons.\n* Engaging soundtrack and audio.\n* Three tours, between 5 and 10 minutes each.", "short_description": "A breath-taking space discovery experience through a series of guided and narrated tours."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://discoveringvr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://discoveringvr.com/eula/", "publisher_name": "DiscoveringVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://discoveringvr.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPLORATION", "SPACE_UNIVERSE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "243675947931432"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12427574_557277051313711_2798724625649893376_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_p5zlIWDxvAQ7kNvwEHe